NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY NAMES

Manufacturer and brand names appearing in this repository (Milwaukee, 3M, AZEK,
Frigidaire, NIBCO, Moen and others) are the trademarks of their respective
owners. They appear here only as realistic examples of industrial catalogue
data, in a hackathon prototype. No affiliation or endorsement is implied.

The documents in data/docs/ are reconstructed fixtures generated by
tools/make_documents.py. They are not captures of any manufacturer's website,
and every entry is flagged `"reconstructed": true` in data/docs/index.json.
